cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Sietch Research, cite this metadata."
title: "Sietch Research"
abstract: >-
  Draft research design and an offline sandbox for studying how two
  persistent agents plan, hand off work, and recover from failure under
  human supervision. A connection to Dune: Awakening is disabled until
  written permission exists. The project is not affiliated with or
  endorsed by Funcom.
